namespace Dakota {

/** \page SpecChange Modifying Dakota's Input Specification

%Dakota's canonical input grammar is the Pydantic model tree under
\c python/dakota/spec. The parser under
\c packages/dakota_parser/dakota_parser consumes the generated JSON Schema
and materializes validated input into the map-based intermediate
representation used by ProblemDescDB.

See \ref PydanticSpec for the complete procedure for adding a keyword,
authoring \c DakotaField materialization metadata, assigning IR defaults,
implementing validation, regenerating parser and IR sources, and testing the
result. Legacy NIDR handlers and Data classes are no longer part of this
workflow.

*/

} // namespace Dakota
